  "description": "Edenhurst, a beautiful paradise. Anastasia, the only one not permitted there. Just as she was waiting for the end of her life, having accepted a future that would never change, a man appears before her. He shatters the god she has always believed in and shakes the paradise to its core...\n\nA woman tamed like a possession and a man determined to take everything from her. Where will this relationship, which began with ruin, ultimately lead?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
